    <briefdescription>
<para>Class implementing a behavior tree action node to set planning mode. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class provides functionality to set planning modes in CoHAN. It inherits from <ref refid="classhateb__local__planner_1_1StatefulActionNodeROS" kindref="compound">StatefulActionNodeROS</ref> to integrate with ROS and behavior tree framework. </para>
